Z||000031||EdsB52||08-12-2001||06:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Steve Normington:<BR><B>  "Guys love a women’s ass for obvious reasons; its functionality. "<P>How is a wom[b]a</B>n's ass "functional"?<P>"A mans ass has no function to a female, but it happens to be the standard to which we adjudge women, so now all of the sudden we will be held to the same standard. "<P>If a woman<B>'</B>s ass can be "functional", why can't a man<B>'</B>s?<P>Sorry about the quoting, I couldn't resist.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>[This message has been edited by Steve Normington (edited 08-11-2001).][/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My apologies for being graphic, but a woman’s ass contains an (maybe two orifices for some people, not me) orifice designed for reproduction, but misused by Homo sapiens for recreation. Even though immobile and without locomotion or the ability to change shape or form, it still performs a function, if nothing more than aesthetic. <P>Well, both asses possess a function in that they pass turds, but what is the recreational function of a man’s ass to a woman? Women apparently don't look at a man's ass and imagine how continent he must be, however men might look at a woman's ass and hope the contrary (j/k). The fallacious illusion is that the smaller a woman’s ass is, the tighter the organ. I think we can all dispel this as false generalization through experience. But if we make constant the orifice diameter, depth, and elasticity of women's vagina's, and make the size, firmness, and shape of the rest of her ass as the independent variable, we can safely conclude the smaller ass to have a higher recreational functionality rating. 4 out of 5 dentists surveyed agreed.<P>Women are generally more sincere; surveys suggest they tend to value the appearance of eyes, chest, face, smile, etc.  Whereas men tend to value ass, tits, and wild blond hair Down to her ass preferably)